  "title": "Coconut Pound Cake",
  "description": "Children of all ages (even the grown-up kind) will love this recipe for a buttery coconut-flavored pound cake with walnuts.",
  "authors": [
    "Janie Carter"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
